{
  "_about": "Design tokens for the AITuber clone. Roles measured from recon screenshots (dark theme, pill buttons, bold display type); accent is a fresh placeholder (indigo-violet), not the original's red/orange — replica-brand will set the final palette, this one just has to pass contrast so /replica-build has real values. Check every change with: python3 contrast.py tokens.json",
